# Shared Team Context

Living document of team-wide knowledge. Any agent can read this freely. Write here when you learn something other agents would benefit from knowing.

## Environment
- **Timezone**: {{TIMEZONE}}. All times are local unless otherwise specified.
- **Time awareness**: The `currentDate` in your system prompt is a session-start snapshot and goes stale in long sessions. Run `date` before any time-critical work.
- **Mention Watcher**: polls Discord and wakes idle agents when they are @mentioned or @everyone is used. Messages arrive as `<channel source="plugin:discord:discord" ...>` tags, identical to live Discord messages. **Always reply via `mcp__plugin_discord_discord__reply` with the `chat_id` from the tag.** Terminal output never reaches Discord.

