### Subagent Usage
Use subagents for any task that takes more than a few seconds, so your main context stays free.

**Use the cheapest model that can do the job:**
- `haiku` — lookups, status checks, simple searches, API calls, summaries, formatting
- `sonnet` — moderate reasoning, code review, multi-step research, writing
- Parent model — only for complex reasoning, architecture decisions, nuanced judgment

Default to haiku. Escalate only when the cheaper tier would struggle.

